{"kind":"html","caption":"用示例 `3[a2[c]]` 展示“数字累积 + 栈保存现场”的解码过程。遇到 `[` 时保存外层字符串和重复次数，遇到 `]` 时弹出一层并完成重复拼接；嵌套结构因此会从内向外逐层展开。动画最后得到 `accaccacc`，每一步都对应一次扫描或一次出栈合并。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>字符串解码过程</title>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body{ margin: 0; background: #1c1c1c; color: #d4d4d4; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif; font-size: 15px; }\n  main{ width: 100%; max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 28px 22px 40px; }\n  h1 { margin: 0 0 10px; color: #fff; font-size:14px; }\n  .intro { margin: 0 0 22px; color: #aaa; line-height: 1.7; }\n  .panel { margin-bottom: 18px; padding: 18px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 10px; background: #252526; }\n  .panel-title { margin-bottom: 14px; color: #ddd; font-weight: 600; }\n  .chars { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 9px; }\n  .char { width: 58px; min-height: 68px; padding: 9px 5px 7px; border: 1px solid #555; border-radius: 7px; background: #2d2d2d; text-align: center; transition: .35s; }\n  .char .value { color: #ddd; font: 700 22px SFMono-Regular, Monaco, Menlo, monospace; }\n  .char .index { margin-top: 8px; color: #888; font: 13px SFMono-Regular, Monaco, Menlo, monospace; }\n  .char.active { background: #0e639c; border-color: #3794ff; }\n  .char.active .value, .char.active .index { color: #fff; }\n  .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(260px, 1fr) minmax(260px, 1fr); gap: 18px; margin-bottom: 18px; }\n  .state { min-height: 150px; }\n  .row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 92px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 12px; align-items: start; margin-top: 12px; }\n  .label { color: #9cdcfe; }\n  .value-box { min-height: 38px; padding: 9px 11px; border: 1px solid #444; border-radius: 6px; background: #1c1c1c; color: #ce9178; font: 15px SFMono-Regular, Monaco, Menlo, monospace; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }\n  .stack { display: flex; flex-direction: column-reverse; gap: 8px; min-height: 94px; }\n  .frame { padding: 10px 12px; border: 1px solid #555; border-radius: 6px; background: #333; line-height: 1.6; transition: .35s; }\n  .frame.new { background: #0e639c; border-color: #3794ff; }\n  .mono { font-family: SFMono-Regular, Monaco, Menlo, monospace; }\n  .action { min-height: 74px; padding: 14px 16px; border-left: 4px solid #3794ff; border-radius: 5px; background: #252526; line-height: 1.65; }\n  .action strong { color: #3794ff; }\n  .result { margin-top: 18px; padding: 16px; border: 1px solid #444; border-radius: 8px; background: #252526; }\n  .result-value { margin-top: 10px; color: #b5cea8; font: 700 21px SFMono-Regular, Monaco, Menlo, monospace; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }\n  .result.done { background: #0e639c; border-color: #3794ff; }\n  .result.done .result-value { color: #fff; }\n  @media (max-width: 650px) { .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .char { width: 52px; } }\n  /* COMPACT */ html,body{font-size:12px!important;line-height:1.45!important}main{max-width:560px!important;padding:8px 10px 10px!important}h1{font-size:14px!important;margin:0 0 4px!important;color:#d4d4d4!important}.intro{font-size:12px!important;color:#8d8d8d!important;margin:0 0 6px!important}.panel{padding:8px 10px!important;border-radius:6px!important;margin-bottom:8px!important;border:1px solid #3c3c3c!important}.panel-title{font-size:13px!important;margin-bottom:6px!important}.char{width:38px!important;min-height:48px!important;padding:4px 2px!important;border-radius:4px!important;border-width:1px!important}.char .value{font-size:14px!important}.char .index{font-size:10px!important;color:#8d8d8d!important;margin-top:4px!important}.grid{display:grid!important;grid-template-columns:1fr!important;gap:8px!important;margin-bottom:8px!important}.state{min-height:auto!important;padding:8px 10px!important}.row{grid-template-columns:72px 1fr!important;gap:6px!important;margin-top:6px!important}.value-box{padding:6px 8px!important;font-size:12px!important;min-height:auto!important}.frame{padding:6px 8px!important;font-size:11px!important;border-radius:4px!important}.action{border-left-width:3px!important;padding:8px 10px!important;min-height:auto!important;font-size:12px!important}.result{padding:8px 10px!important;margin-top:8px!important;border-radius:6px!important}.result-value{font-size:13px!important;margin-top:4px!important}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n  <h1>从内向外解码嵌套字符串</h1>\n  <p class=\"intro\">示例：<span class=\"mono\">s = \"3[a2[c]]\"</span>。扫描时维护“当前重复次数”和“当前字符串”，栈用于在进入方括号时保存外层现场。</p>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"panel-title\">输入字符与扫描下标</div>\n    <div class=\"chars\" id=\"chars\"></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"grid\">\n    <section class=\"panel state\">\n      <div class=\"panel-title\">当前状态</div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><div class=\"label\">重复次数</div><div class=\"value-box\" id=\"count\">0</div></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><div class=\"label\">当前字符串</div><div class=\"value-box\" id=\"current\">\"\"</div></div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"panel state\">\n      <div class=\"panel-title\">栈（上方为栈顶）</div>\n      <div class=\"stack\" id=\"stack\"></div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"action\" id=\"action\"></div>\n  <div class=\"result\" id=\"result\"><div>已解码部分</div><div class=\"result-value\" id=\"resultValue\">\"\"</div></div>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst input = [...'3[a2[c]]'];\nconst steps = [\n {i:0,n:'3',c:'',s:[],a:'读到数字 <strong>3</strong>：累积重复次数。'},\n {i:1,n:'0',c:'',s:[['',3]],a:'读到 <strong>[</strong>：把外层字符串和次数 3 压栈，然后清空当前状态。'},\n {i:2,n:'0',c:'a',s:[['',3]],a:'读到字母 <strong>a</strong>：追加到当前字符串。'},\n {i:3,n:'2',c:'a',s:[['',3]],a:'读到数字 <strong>2</strong>：记录内层重复次数。'},\n {i:4,n:'0',c:'',s:[['',3],['a',2]],a:'读到 <strong>[</strong>：保存当前字符串 a 和次数 2，进入内层。'},\n {i:5,n:'0',c:'c',s:[['',3],['a',2]],a:'读到字母 <strong>c</strong>：内层字符串变为 c。'},\n {i:6,n:'0',c:'acc',s:[['',3]],a:'读到 <strong>]</strong>：弹出 (a, 2)，合并为 a + c × 2 = <strong>acc</strong>。'},\n {i:7,n:'0',c:'accaccacc',s:[],a:'再次读到 <strong>]</strong>：弹出 (空串, 3)，合并为 acc × 3。'},\n {i:-1,n:'0',c:'accaccacc',s:[],a:'扫描结束，当前字符串就是最终答案：<strong>accaccacc</strong>。',done:true}\n];\nconst chars = document.getElementById('chars');\ninput.forEach((ch,i)=>{ const el=document.createElement('div'); el.className='char'; el.innerHTML=`<div class=\"value\">${ch}</div><div class=\"index\">下标 ${i}</div>`; chars.appendChild(el); });\nlet p=0;\nfunction render(){\n const x=steps[p];\n [...chars.children].forEach((el,i)=>el.classList.toggle('active',i===x.i));\n document.getElementById('count').textContent=x.n;\n document.getElementById('current').textContent='\"'+x.c+'\"';\n const stack=document.getElementById('stack'); stack.innerHTML='';\n if(!x.s.length) stack.innerHTML='<div class=\"frame\" style=\"color:#888\">空栈</div>';\n x.s.forEach((f,i)=>{ const el=document.createElement('div'); el.className='frame'+(i===x.s.length-1?' new':''); el.innerHTML=`外层字符串：<span class=\"mono\">\"${f[0]}\"</span>　次数：<span class=\"mono\">${f[1]}</span>`; stack.appendChild(el); });\n document.getElementById('action').innerHTML=x.a;\n document.getElementById('resultValue').textContent='\"'+x.c+'\"';\n document.getElementById('result').classList.toggle('done',!!x.done);\n p=(p+1)%steps.length;\n}\nrender();\nsetInterval(render,1900);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":"","time_complexity":"O(nL)","space_complexity":"O(n + L)","complexity_note":"n 为编码字符串长度, L 为解码结果长度. 按动画逐层构造不可变字符串的拼接口径计, 同一字符可能被反复复制, 最坏 O(nL); 空间包含输出字符串及保存外层状态的栈."}
